---
/**
 * Server-rendered stand-in for the Sources island, shown until React hydrates.
 *
 * Blocks rather than words: it is aria-hidden, so it exists to hold the window's shape and stop
 * the tab strip jumping when the island arrives, not to say anything. Four cards, because the
 * catalogue has four sources and this one is not a list that grows with what happened.
 */
---

<div class="ev-skel" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="ev-skel-head"></div>
  <div class="ev-skel-card"></div>
  <div class="ev-skel-card"></div>
  <div class="ev-skel-card"></div>
  <div class="ev-skel-card ev-skel-card--short"></div>
</div>
